<===> README.md
These will be errors in Dart Sass 2.0.0.

<===>
================================================================================
<===> matching/dash/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@include meta.load-css("other", $with: ("-a": b));

<===> matching/dash/_other.scss
$-a: c !default;
d {e: $-a}

<===> matching/dash/output.css
d {
  e: b;
}

<===> matching/dash/warning
DEPRECATION WARNING [with-private]: Configuring private variables (such as $-a) is deprecated.
This will be an error in Dart Sass 2.0.0.

  ,
2 | @include meta.load-css("other", $with: ("-a": b));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
    input.scss 2:1  root stylesheet

